From bf7f64075af80eea9babc7c6179009ccc6c8df19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:23:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v2.5: bridge battery saves to v3.x passwords

Built on v2.4 for players with a battery save from v1.0-v2.4 (v2.4
already converts v1.x-v2.3 saves on load). OPTIONS > PASSWORD (in place
of ERASE SAVE) shows the PLAYER (32 letters, with stats) and GARAGE
passwords in the v3.1+ format, using the v3.x password encoder in bank 5.
The release is published with make_latest: false so the download buttons
keep pointing at the newest version.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Pa1irVVgbhgX6AcbsKKncE
